type: software
title: "SemCred-FL: LLM-Guided Dual-View Credibility Aggregation for Robust Federated Intrusion Detection under Data Poisoning"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
abstract: >-
  Research implementation of SemCred-FL, a federated intrusion-detection
  aggregation method that combines offline semantic evidence with numerical
  update evidence, persistent trust, eligibility filtering, and clipping.
